<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">!%UserFirstName%!,<br><br>This notice is to inform you that an individual has selected to stop sharing Intel&reg; Technology Provider programme information with the selected Intel&reg; Authorised Distributors and/or Intel&reg; Approved Suppliers (Service Providers).<br>
</p><ul style="font-size: 11px;">
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Business Account Name: </b>!%AccountName%!</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Account Number: </b>!%AccountNumber%!</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Primary Contact Who Made the Selection(s): </b>!%UserEmailAddr%!</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Date: </b>!%DateSigned%!</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Service Provider(s) Selected: </b>!%Distributors%!</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Authorisation: </b>I hereby authorise Intel to share with the Service Provider(s) information about my Intel&reg; Technology Provider Programme account to help manage my benefits. I also authorise Intel to allow them to make points redemptions on my behalf (not available in APJ).</li>
</ul>

<p></p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">If you do not approve of this action or feel that an error has been made, <a href="https://crmdevipa-intelcloudcrm.cs45.force.com/ipa/s/companyprofile"  style="color:#FF0000;">you can modify the selections or opt out</a>.<br>If you have any questions, please contact us at programs@intel.com.<br>
<br>Thank you,<br>Your Intel&reg; Partner Alliance team</p>
